        "original_id": "788c79f4-009e-5429-b966-52e274f4e3b2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Catherine O'Hara, Charlie Tahan, Winona Ryder, Martin Short, Christopher Guest, Tim Burton\n- Films and TV: Frankenweenie, Beetlejuice, Edward Scissorhands, The Nightmare Before Christmas, Mars Attacks!, Second City Television, After Hours, Home Alone, Waiting for Guffman, Best in Show, A Mighty Wind, For Your Consideration, Ozark\n- Roles: Victor Frankenstein, Wyatt\n\nFacts:\n- Catherine Anne O'Hara was born on March 4, 1954, and she is a Canadian-American actress, writer, and comedian.\n- Catherine O'Hara was known for comedy work on Second City Television from 1976 to 1984.\n- Catherine O'Hara appeared in the films After Hours (1985), Beetlejuice (1988), Home Alone (1990), and The Nightmare Before Christmas (1993).\n- Catherine O'Hara also appeared in Christopher Guest's mockumentary films Waiting for Guffman (1996), Best in Show (2000), A Mighty Wind (2003), and For Your Consideration (2006).\n- Charles \"Charlie\" Tahan was born on June 11, 1998, and he is an American actor.\n- Charlie Tahan is known for playing Wyatt on Ozark and for voicing Victor Frankenstein in the animated film Frankenweenie.\n- The 2012 film Frankenweenie had voice cast members who had previously worked with Tim Burton, including Winona Ryder, Catherine O'Hara, and Martin Short.\n- Winona Ryder had previously worked with Tim Burton on Beetlejuice and Edward Scissorhands.\n- Catherine O'Hara had previously worked with Tim Burton on Beetlejuice and The Nightmare Before Christmas.\n- Martin Short had previously worked with Tim Burton on Mars Attacks!.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
